{"about_the_game":"Mysterious creatures have emerged from the realm only known as the Velvet.<br>With the ability to materialize projectiles from thin air, they are wrecking havoc on the mortal realm.<br>But hope is on the horizon; some of the creatures are fighting back against the others, pushing them into the Velvet again.<br>Nobody knows why they are fighting back, but they have been given the name &quot;Velvet Guard&quot;.<br>Help the mortal realm fight back and possess the Velvet Guard!<br><br>Velvet Guard is an 8-player party game with intense and hilarious versus matches. The core mechanics are simple and accessible; you have a fixed amount of projectiles that, after being fired, can be picked up by anyone. With different game modes and options, each gameplay is never the same. With a wide array of abilities and expressive depth, the game can be quite challenging and fun.<br><br>Notable features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Diverse abilities to change up your gameplay and challenge your skills<br></li><li>Fast paced combat<br></li><li>A wide range of levels with their own unique style and interactions<br></li><li>A level editor to upload custom levels to the workshop</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/822810?t=1752837874","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/822810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752837874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/822810/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752837874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/822810/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752837874","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"de